  "body_html": "<h4><strong>If you are a paid subscriber, ignore this post and have a wonderful day! You will be grandfathered in.</strong></h4><p>Over the past year, StockTok has grown rapidly and consistently appeared on Substack’s fastest-rising lists. Thank you. From the beginning, my goal has been to build a <strong>smaller, more serious investing community</strong>, not a massive one. In my experience, large free communities eventually get diluted—less focus, more noise, and a worse experience for people who are actually here to invest.</p><p>To protect the quality of this community, I’m following through on something I’ve mentioned before. The price for <strong>new subscribers</strong> will increase:</p><p>• $8/month (or $80/year) → <strong>$41.86/month (or $418.56/year)</strong></p><p>Below, I’ll explain what you get, review 2025 performance, and show exactly why the price is $41.86.</p><h3>What you get</h3><p>After reviewing many finance Substacks, one thing stood out: high prices, vague commentary, inconsistent posting, and very little accountability. I’m mentioning this because <strong>StockTok is intentionally the opposite</strong>.</p><p>About <strong>80% of my content is free</strong>. The <strong>paid portion</strong> is where I’m explicit, accountable, and involved.</p><p><strong>Paid subscribers get:</strong></p><p><strong>1. Direct, unambiguous stock picks</strong><br>I clearly state when I am buying or shorting a stock, the price range, and my preferred stop levels. My trades are always posted; no hindsight, no vagueness. Adjust sizing or risk to your own preferences and feel free to ask me if you have questions.</p><p><strong>2. <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stocktok-summary-fc6?r=4z8lgl\">StockTok Screener and Summary</a></strong><br>The StockTok Screener scans ~5,000 stocks daily to find high-volume breakouts from consolidation. Most of my own trades originate here, and many subscribers use it daily. If you are curious about past performance, check out <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/screener-continues-to-find-monster?r=4z8lgl\">Screener Performance Update</a>. You also get a live summary of all my positions with entries, stops, and running P/L—updated every day. It looks like this presently:</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><div class=\"image-link image2\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!9ya-!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbfc71ef6-2351-4096-b0ec-ab3e1437b92c_1096x248.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!9ya-!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbfc71ef6-2351-4096-b0ec-ab3e1437b92c_1096x248.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!9ya-!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbfc71ef6-2351-4096-b0ec-ab3e1437b92c_1096x248.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!9ya-!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbfc71ef6-2351-4096-b0ec-ab3e1437b92c_1096x248.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!9ya-!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbfc71ef6-2351-4096-b0ec-ab3e1437b92c_1096x248.png\" width=\"1096\" height=\"248\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/bfc71ef6-2351-4096-b0ec-ab3e1437b92c_1096x248.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:248,&quot;width&quot;:1096,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:162971,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/183791899?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F203b8acd-0447-4fef-825b-d0437a9b483e_1104x248.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!9ya-!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbfc71ef6-2351-4096-b0ec-ab3e1437b92c_1096x248.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!9ya-!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbfc71ef6-2351-4096-b0ec-ab3e1437b92c_1096x248.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!9ya-!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbfc71ef6-2351-4096-b0ec-ab3e1437b92c_1096x248.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!9ya-!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbfc71ef6-2351-4096-b0ec-ab3e1437b92c_1096x248.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div></div></div></div></figure></div><p><strong>3. Direct access to me</strong><br>Paid members have access to the <a href=\"https://substack.com/chat/3537822\">Main Chat</a> during market hours. I treat this as a service: if you’re paying, I’m available. You won’t get trade advice, but I’ll discuss charts, risk, stops, and process. The group stays focused, constructive, and serious.</p><h3>StockTok Performance</h3><p>All my results are updated daily—no cherry-picking and no hiding losses. You see outcomes in real time.</p><p>Below are all 2025 stock picks and their performance. Losses were contained through position sizing and <strong>dollar-cost averaging up (DCA UP)</strong>—adding to winning, trending positions while reducing exposure to losing ones. For example, a ~$4,200 loss in AISP was more than offset by over ~$30,000 in Roblox by adding as the trend worked in our favor. When I DCA UP, I state it explicitly.</p><p><strong>2025 results:</strong></p><ul><li><p><strong>69.23% win rate</strong></p></li><li><p><strong>Net gain: 314%</strong></p></li><li><p><strong>Average gain per winner: 7.09%</strong></p></li><li><p><strong>Largest win:</strong> Roblox +61% (compounded 3×)</p></li><li><p><strong>Largest loss:</strong> Airship AI −42%</p></li></ul><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!0C-1!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9a5d4d39-a6be-460a-806b-dcddd3b28ea8_1168x1644.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!0C-1!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9a5d4d39-a6be-460a-806b-dcddd3b28ea8_1168x1644.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!0C-1!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9a5d4d39-a6be-460a-806b-dcddd3b28ea8_1168x1644.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!0C-1!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9a5d4d39-a6be-460a-806b-dcddd3b28ea8_1168x1644.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!0C-1!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9a5d4d39-a6be-460a-806b-dcddd3b28ea8_1168x1644.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!0C-1!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9a5d4d39-a6be-460a-806b-dcddd3b28ea8_1168x1644.png\" width=\"1168\" height=\"1644\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/9a5d4d39-a6be-460a-806b-dcddd3b28ea8_1168x1644.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:1644,&quot;width&quot;:1168,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:1035672,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/183791899?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9a5d4d39-a6be-460a-806b-dcddd3b28ea8_1168x1644.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!0C-1!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9a5d4d39-a6be-460a-806b-dcddd3b28ea8_1168x1644.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!0C-1!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9a5d4d39-a6be-460a-806b-dcddd3b28ea8_1168x1644.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!0C-1!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9a5d4d39-a6be-460a-806b-dcddd3b28ea8_1168x1644.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!0C-1!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9a5d4d39-a6be-460a-806b-dcddd3b28ea8_1168x1644.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><h3>Why $41.86</h3><p>When I started this Substack, I priced it at $8 or $9 simply because that’s what Substack recommended. Over the past year, I’ve built the screener, published consistently, tracked every trade publicly, and spent time analyzing how other finance Substacks operate.</p><p>Most are priced in the $40–$45 range. The difference is that many rely on irregular posting, vague commentary, AI slop or recycled market narratives with limited accountability…many while behind an anonymous account.</p><p>I don’t guess at pricing. I benchmarked pages comparable in topic and audience and found the average price to be <strong>$41.85</strong>. Given the daily updates, transparent trade tracking, live screener, and direct access I provide, <strong>$41.86 is simply fair</strong>.</p><p>This price isn’t for everyone. That’s intentional. I’d rather work with a smaller, professional group than run a massive, unfocused community. If this approach fits you, you’ll get full value from it.</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!6AUq!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa889d5e5-0c69-4eb5-a1b3-56cce7d88728_960x540.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!6AUq!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa889d5e5-0c69-4eb5-a1b3-56cce7d88728_960x540.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!6AUq!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa889d5e5-0c69-4eb5-a1b3-56cce7d88728_960x540.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!6AUq!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa889d5e5-0c69-4eb5-a1b3-56cce7d88728_960x540.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!6AUq!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa889d5e5-0c69-4