mages%2Fa889d5e5-0c69-4eb5-a1b3-56cce7d88728_960x540.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">Many of these accounts throw out AI slop, no stock picks, no video content and disappear on their subscribers. Not us. I blurred their profile pictures so to not start online beefs.</figcaption></figure></div><p>The price will increase <strong>Friday, January 9th at market close</strong>.</p><p>If you’re on the fence, this page may not be for you, and that’s fine. About <strong>80% of my work is free</strong> and will stay that way. The paid tier is for people who want full transparency, real positions, and an active process.</p><p>Occasionally, ideas like <strong>ONDS</strong> move quickly after I mention them. That won’t always happen and that’s the point. This isn’t about tips. It’s about being positioned <strong>before</strong> moves develop.</p><p>If this approach fits how you invest, you’re welcome to join before the price changes. If not, you’ll still get value here.</p><p>Questions are welcome. I read everything. Here is <a href=\"https://substack.com/@stocktok/note/c-186765553?r=4z8lgl&amp;utm_source=notes-share-action&amp;utm_medium=web\">What others think</a> about StockTok if you want someone else’s opinion.</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!lzBv!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F803b6eda-95f7-4d27-a810-c2c09355bae9_2700x1838.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!lzBv!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F803b6eda-95f7-4d27-a810-c2c09355bae9_2700x1838.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!lzBv!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F803b6eda-95f7-4d27-a810-c2c09355bae9_2700x1838.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!lzBv!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F803b6eda-95f7-4d27-a810-c2c09355bae9_2700x1838.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!lzBv!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progress